Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.70,0:28:15.70,ED2 - English (v0),,0,0,0,,Eu preciso saber!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.71,0:28:17.47,ED2 - English (v0),,0,0,0,,Eu acredito, acredito em você
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.71,0:28:17.47,ED2 - Romaji (v0),,0,0,0,,{\blur5\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(205,250,\1a&H00&)\t(1510,1555,\1a&HFF&)}{\fad(250,250)\3c&H000000&\c&H000000&\3a&H19&}I believe, believe in you
