Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.47,0:28:21.49,ED2 - English (v0),,0,0,0,,Tenho certeza de que é a promessa mais importante que já fiz
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.49,0:28:25.80,ED2 - Romaji (v0),,0,0,0,,{\blur5\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(205,250,\1a&H00&)\t(4420,4465,\1a&HFF&)}{\fad(250,600)\3c&H000000&\c&H000000&\3a&H19&}itai kurai nigitte hanasanai
Dialogue: 1,0:28:21.49,0:28:25.80,ED2 - Romaji (v0),,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.5\4a&HFF&}{\fad(250,600)\3a&H19&}itai kurai nigitte hanasanai
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.49,0:28:25.80,ED2 - English (v0),,0,0,0,,Por isso vou me agarrar a ela e não vou soltar
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.16,0:28:28.75,ED2 - Romaji (v0),,0,0,0,,{\blur5\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(205,250,\1a&H00&)\t(2340,2385,\1a&HFF&)}{\fad(250,250)\3c&H000000&\c&H000000&\3a&H19&}wagamama na ima tsurete
