Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.62,0:28:39.82,ED2 - English (v0),,0,0,0,,Se você estender suas mãos em prece
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.82,0:28:45.09,ED2 - Romaji (v0),,0,0,0,,{\blur5\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(205,250,\1a&H00&)\t(5020,5065,\1a&HFF&)}{\fad(250,250)\3c&H000000&\c&H000000&\3a&H19&}inori no te wo
